Package: kali-list
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, apt, dpkg
Description: compact APT package and command catalog for Kali Linux
 Browse package names, sections, versions, and executable commands without
 printing extended package documentation. Package data is read from the local
 APT cache and command data is read from installed Debian packages.
